===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|rare|chiefly|in the plural}} An instance of being sufficient, or of doing something sufficiently.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1909|author=Edwin Balmer|title=[[wikisource:Waylaid by Wireless/Chapter 2|Waylaid by Wireless: A Suspicion, a Warning, a Sporting Proposition, and a Transatlantic Pursuit]]|page=29
|passage=And she was neither beautiful nor handsome, but just at the point halfway between which a girl of twenty-three reaches who inherits good features and healthful figure, and who has learned to dance well, ride well, study enough, golf enough, and has attained the thousand other "well and '''enoughs'''" which include talking well and listening enough, and allow a woman to be liked and loved with so little consciousness that she never suspects she is particularly liked at all.}}

